lder) Master plus femenine (60 or older) PRIZES 1st, 2nd, 3rd racer of the Masculine and Feminine General Classification. Economic prizes. 1st racer of each category. Non economic prizes. Prizes are NOT acumulative TRAIL 25k SERRA DE MONTSANT SUNDAY, October 11th 2026 TRAILSERIES 21K BY SPORTY Scoring: Trailseries 21k: 39 points ITRA: 1 point UTMB/ITRA: Qualifier 20kUTMB-INDEX/2 points Distance: 24,7Km Positive drop: 1.263m Maximum time: 6.00h Starting time: 9.30h Starting place: Swimming pool, Ulldemolins centre town Provisioning posts: 4 official CPs Km 4,1 (water) Km 12,1 (water + isotonic + coke + fruits + biscuits) km 18,0 (water + isotonic + coke + fruits + biscuits) km 22,2 (water + fruits) ISOTONIC Will allow us to find Isotonic drinks to consume on-site at the provisioning posts. ECO-RACE There will be not plastic glasses throughout the race. You must to have a reusable glass on the race. If you want. the organization will sell you a special glass to be used throughout the race. Liquid provisioning posta will only have water. At the light and complete provisioning posts there will be other drinks, but they can only be drunk in situ. Cans or other racers’ drink containers can only be filled with water. There will be a light refreshment at the finish line. CATEGORIES Junior masculine (16 to 20 years old) Junior femenine (16 to 20 years old) Veterano masculine (40 to 49 years old) Veterena femenine (40 to 49 years old) Master maculine (50 to 59 years old) Master femenine (50 to 59 years old) Master plus masculine (+60 years old) Master plus femenine ( +60 years old) PRIZES To the 1st, 2nd and 3rd of the general masculine and femenine classification. To the 1st racer of each category. To the 1st local racer. Prizes are NOT acumulative. TRAIL11k/TREK11 SERRA DE MONTSANT SUNDAY october 11th 2026 Trailseries 10k/Lliga TGN Trail BY SPORTY Trailseries 10k scoring: 17 points Distance: 11km Positive slope: 621m Maximum time: 4.30h 1st Starting time: 10.00h Starting place: Simming pool, Ulldemolins centre town. Provisioning posts: 2 official CPs: km 4,1 Water km 8,5 Water + fruits (Santa Magdalena Ermnitage) ISOTONIC Will allow us to find Isotonic drinks to consume on-site at the provisioning posts. ECO-RACE There will be not plastic glasses throughout the race. You must to have a reusable glass on the race. If you want. the organization will sell you a special glass to be used throughout the race. Liquid provisioning posta will only have water. At the light and complete provisioning posts there will be other drinks, but they can only be drunk in situ. Cans or other racers’ drink containers can only be filled with water. There will be a light refreshment at the finish line. CATEGORIES Junior masculine (14 to 20 years old) Junior femenine (14 to 20 years old) Veterano masculine (40 to 49 years old) Veterena femenine (40 to 49 years old) Master maculine (50 to 59 years old) Master femenine (50 to 59 years old) Master plus masculine (60 to 64 years old ) Master plus femenine ( 60 to 64 years old) Master Gold masculine (+65 years old) master Gold femenine (+65 years old) PRIZES To the 1st, 2nd and 3rd of the general masculine and femenine classification. To the 1st racer of each category. Prizes are NOT cumulative TREK 11K CATEGORIES Masculine (07 to 99 years) Femenine (07 to 99 years) PRIZES No prizes START TRAIL 7K SUNDAY, october 11th 2026 Distance: 7.180m Positive slope: +240 m Negative slope: -240 m Provisioning post: km 4,1 Water Finish line. Maximum time: 4.00h Starting hour: 10.05h Starting place: Swimming pool in Ulldemolins centre. Ideal from 3 years old. ULTRAXIC SUPERHEROES: during 2025 children under 12 years old will only pay 2€ for insurance, race bib and refreshments, and must be accompanied by an adult. Maximum 3 minors per adult. Registration process: Adults Initiation: normal process through the web or shop. Families: the adult has to sign up following the normal process through the web or the shop and notify how many children will accompany him/her. On the day of the race, the amount of the children will be paid when picking up the bib. NON COMPETITIVE PRIZES Finisher prize for the minors  REGULATIONS/Rules ESP-CAT-ENG_2026 UTSM_26_Reglamento_ESP_CAT_ENG_compressed  REGULATIONS TRAIL SERIES -2026 Reglament_Curses_trailSERIES_Costa_Daurada_2026_feb  2025 TIM"},{"url":"https://www.naturetime.es/en/cursa-dones-cambrils-3/","hash":"8bee6484c33f71e0e4337b2eeb2397bf3b07121f2cfdf6b812e1c63b58971bd5","chars":8203,"text":"Español Català English Select Page CAmbrils womEn S race #OnlyYesisYes #RESPecTMe 1050 THANKS! WAITING YOU ON 2027! RESULTS / RACE TRACKING 7TH JUNE 2026  JUNE 7TH 2026  4 EVERYONE . } 09:00h . Presentation Technical data PROGRAM PRiCeS Route VOLUNTeeRS + INFO PhotoS/SN Sponsors MENÚ Presentation Technical data Program Prices Route Volunteers + Info Photos/SN Sponsors presentation CAMBRILS WOMEN S RACE #OnlyYesisYes # RespectMe! For everyone! On June 7th, you have an appointment in Cambrils where you can make yourself heard at the rhythm of running, in a special race for you: 5 km by the sea Be part of the purple tide! If you like sport, running, jogging or walking, if you are a man or a woman, if you defend equality You deserve to be at the starting line. All of us doing sport under the same motto: #OnlyYesisYes #RespectMe And the little ones, there will be children s races according to age! THE CAMBRILS OPERATOR AT THE SIDE OF THE RACE A provider of cutting-edge fibre and telephony technologies and services with scalable solutions for businesses of all sizes, offering innovative and intelligent services, as well as internet and telephony services for individuals. At The Nut Club, we don’t just make nut butters — we create an experience where authentic flavour and wellbeing go hand in hand. We are committed to 100% natural ingredients, with no added sugars or sweeteners, to deliver the highest purity and quality in every jar. Our nut butters are made to be enjoyed, to help you take care of yourself, and to support a more conscious choice for the planet, because true pleasure starts with what you choose. CHARITY COMPONENT In this edition, the charity component of the race joins forces with the organization LA LLIGA CONTRA EL CÀNCER COMARQUES TARRAGONA I TERRES DE L EBRE , allocating the donations collected to the organization to help fight this disease. technical data Race Director: Joan Carbonell Mobile: 606451453 (10 a 15h) women s raCE 5K Limit: 1200 bibs Participation: Women and men, over 12 years old Distance: 5Km Flat circuit for running or walking. Refreshment point: Km 2,50 CAThEGORIeS INDIVIDUAL Cadet 12 to 15 years Junior 16 to 19 years Senior 20 to 39 years Veteran 40 to 49 years Master 50 to 59 years old Master Plus 60 years and over Local (Cambrils) TEAMS-CLUBS (You have to register individually and indicate the team/club you belong to). -Teams-clubs can be made up of mother and daughter, girlfriend and daughter-in-law, friends, gymnastics friends, etc. but they always have to belong to the same club-team. PRIZES Only runners in the women s category are awarded prizes Top three overall The three best in each individual category Teams-clubs: The THREE best teams (sum of the two best scores of their members) To the youngest (minimum 12 years old) and to the oldest To the entity with the most FINISHERS Best animation team with more than 5 runners. To the best local Non-cumulative prizes except for the Local prize children s races Participation: According to age From 0-4 years old distance: 0,25Km (born 2026 to 2022) From 5-7 years old distance: 0.50km (born 2021 to 2019) From 8-11 years old: 1Km (born 2018 to 2015) Plane circuit around Parc del Pescador area. Finish line refreshment point Cathegories: NON COMPETITIVE ONE Prizes: Medal for everyone  RACE RULES 2026 REGLAMENT_CURSA_DONES_CAMBRILS_V1_130426  MINORS AUTHORISATION Plantilla AutorizacionES Menores CAT ESP  TECHNICAL COMMUNICATION (48 hours before) GUIA CORREDORA CURSA DONES CAMBRILS 2026-V1-ENG  OFFICIAL BIB NUMBER LIST (48 hours before) DORSALS_PENJAR_OK t-SHIRT With each registration you will get a free T-shirt, but you can buy extra T-shirts and headbands at the price of 10€ each, of which 3€ will be extra donations for the LA LLIGA CONTRA EL CÀNCER COMARQUES TARRAGONA I TERRES DE L EBRE DESIGN EDITION 2026 CALCETINES OPCIONAL COMPRA (10€) CINTA OPCIONAL COMPRA (10€) SOLIDARITY COLLECTION 2025 The 2025 edition of the Cursa de les Dones de Cambrils selected the #PELSVALENTS as the beneficiary of the donations made at the event. A total of €1.801 has been raised. THANK YOU VERY MUCH! Summary: -Donations through online registration: 1.316€ -Donations through in-person registrations: 27€ -Sales of solidarity sports equipment: 168€ -Extra donation from the Cursa de les Dones de Cambrils: 290€ SOLIDARITY COLLECTION 2024 The 2024 edition of the Cursa de les Dones de Cambrils selected the Lliga contra el Cancer de la provincia de Tarragona i terres de l Ebre as the beneficiary of the donations made at the event. A total of €1500 has been raised. THANK YOU VERY MUCH! Summary: -Donations through online registration: 1.051€ -Donations through in-person registrations: 79€ -Sales of solidarity sports equipment: 123€ -Extra donation from the Cursa de les Dones de Cambrils: 247€ solidarity collection 2023 The 2023 edition of the Cambrils Cursa de les Dones selected #PelsValents as the beneficiary of the donations made at the event for the Escuts Solidaris project of the Pedriatric Center of the Hospital Sant Pau i Sant Joan from Barcelona. A total of €1,771.20 was raised. THANK YOU VERY MUCH! Summary: -Donations through online registration: 1.015€. -Donations through in-person registrations: 64€. -Sales of solidarity sports equipment: 99€. -Extra contribution from the Cambrils Cursa de les Dones: 122€. -Sales of solidarity material (#PelsValents tent): 471.20€. SOLIDARITY COLLECTION 2022 The 2022 edition of the Cursa de les Dones de Cambrils selected the Lliga contra el Cancer de la provincia de Tarragona i terres de l Ebre as the beneficiary of the donations made at the event. A total of €900 has been raised. THANK YOU VERY MUCH! Summary: -Donations through online registration: 649€ -Donations through in-person registrations: 58€. -Sales of solidarity sports equipment: 110€. -Extra donation from the Cursa de les Dones de Cambrils: 83€. ROUTE KM <CURSA DONES CAMBRILS> Powered by Wikiloc +info  INTERESTING webs Weather forecast: www.meteocat.com www.accuweather.com Area Information: Ajuntament de Cambrils Patronat de Turisme de Cambrils  locker room . SHOWER: Showers will be available at the Cambrils sports centre, a 10-minute walk away. How to get to the sports centre on Sunday JUNE 7th? CLICK HERE  playground . PLAYGROUND: We will have a service for the little ones to play while their parents run the 5k race (8.30-10.15 am) Service cancelled due to lack of reservations.  COLLECTION OF RACE BIBS ON SATURDAY 6TH The bib pick-up point on Saturday 6h JUNE will be located at the CAMBRILS PERSCADOR PARK, south zone. It is recommended to pick up your race bib and runner s bag on Saturday to check your T-shirt size. Hours: 10a.m to 02.00p.m. How to get to the bib pick up on Saturday 6th JUNE? CLICK HERE  START-FINISH AREA ON SUNDAY 7th The race area on Sunday will be located in the Parc del Pescador, Avinguda de les Palmeres 1. The LAST MINUTE race bibs will be handed out there, as well as the entertainment area, prize-giving and the start and finish line. How to get to the start on Sunday 7th JUNE? CLICK HERE RESULTS 2025 race 5K RESULTS 2024 race 5K RESULTS 2023 race 5K photos/social nets FOTOS 2026: GET YOUR PHOTO (NOT YET) FOTOS 2026: PHOTO SUMMARY VOLUNTEERS Do you want to VOLUNTEER for the Women s Race ? You will spend an incredible weekend in a sporty and wonderful environment. Your help can be very important and will be highly valued by the protagonists of this sportive challenge The runners. You can help at the control point, at the refreshment point, indicating at a crossroads, welcoming the runners, handing out bibs, etc We don t run out of tasks! If you have availability and you re up for it we offer you..: Enjoy a sporting environment To live an adventure where you set the limits A gift for you to keep as a souvenir Meet lots of people And in return we ask you: Commitment to the task and assigned schedules. If you are interested send an email to [email protected] or fill out the form and we will contact you. Thank you very much Joan Carbonell, Race Director VOLUNTEER FORM sponsors MAIN sponsors sponsors partners donation beneficiary organises/produces with the support of:"},{"url":"https://www.naturetime.es/cursa-de-nadal-2/","hash":"c5366a534797b15096e4cefe7afc61adad0bc054f4af5b50e2e50ee3eb78f6a8","chars":7775,"text":"Español Català English Seleccionar página CURSA DE NADAL trail 22k TRAIL 12K TREK12K START TRAIL 5K PREMIO ESPECIAL CRONOESCALADA LA MIRANDA 20 DiciEMBRE 2026 domingo mañana ABRIMOS INSCRIPCIONES EN BREVE  PRESENTACIÓN  DATOS TÉCNICOS  INSCRIPCIONES  PROGRAMA  CAMISETA  RECORRIDOS  VOLUNTARIOS  +info  FOTOS/RRSS  PATROCINADORES presentacióN 20 diciembre 2026 2026 CURSA DE NADAL El año pasado ya iniciamos una nueva andadura en las pruebas navideñas, con el afán de que la Cursa de Nadal se convierta en un clásico de las carreras de montaña que se celebran durante estas fechas. Y qué mejor manera de hacerlo que con el Trail Colldejou , que ha pasado a ser la Cursa de Nadal! En sus últimas ediciones, este evento ya había sido programado alrededor de estos días tan entrañables. Así que esperamos que, a partir de ahora, año tras año, sea una cita ineludible para los amantes del trail y un motivo de reencuentro de amistades y competidores para disfrutar de un día de kilómetros por este entorno natural tan fantástico de la Mola de Colldejou, que nos ofrece vistas increíbles de la Costa Daurada y del Montsant desde su privilegiada atalaya. Esperamos que sea una oportunidad para recorrer estos parajes con otro espíritu, un espíritu más navideño y festivo. Así pues, tendremos tres distancias donde escoger: 21k y 10k para los que tengan más ganas de caña y 5k de iniciación o carrera familiar. Cartel provisional 2026 DATOS TÉCNICOS Director de carrera: Joan Carbonell Teléfono: 641 50 84 74 (10 a 15h) cronoescalada la mola de llaberia (la miranda) Abierto a Runners y Caminadores Premio especial para el primer hombre y la primera mujer que coronen la cima de la Mola de Llaberia (la Miranda) Distancia: 3,23km Desnivel positivo: +496m Desnivel negativo: -25m Altitud inicial: 470m Altitud final: 919m TRAIL 22K COLLDEJOU Puntuable Trailseries 21k Distancia: 21.500m Desnivel positivo: 1.385m Puntuación: Trailseries: 35 puntos ITRA: 1 punto UTMB: Qualifier 20k Avituallamientos: CP / km 4,1 / Coll de Colivassos: Agua, isotónico, fruta, sólidos CP / Km 10,7/ Llaberia: Agua, isotónico, fruta, sólidos CP / km 13,4 / Coll de Colivassos: Agua, isotónico, fruta, sólidos CP / Km 18,8: Punto de agua Tiempo máx.: 4h Lugar de salida y llegada: Colldejou Material Obligatorio : 4 imperdibles o sistema de sujeción de dorsal Vaso reutilizable para beber Bidón con líquido 0.5 LITROS mínimo – se han reducido los avituallamientos- Paravientos, que tendrá que ser impermeable waterproof en caso de lluvia. Material recomendado: Gafas de protección por vegetación Calzado técnico y calcetines Manta térmica (seguridad) * Este material puede sufrir cambios que se detallarán en el comunicado técnico antes de la carrera CATEGORÍAS Junior masculino (de 16 a 20 años) / Junior femenino (de 16 a 20 años) Veterano masculino (de 40 a 49 años) / Veterano femenino (de 40 a 49 años) Master masculino (50 a 59 años) / Master femenino (50 a 59 años) Master Plus masculino (60 años o más) / Master Plus femenino (60 años o más) PREMIOS Al primero, segundo y tercero de la Clasificación General masculina y femenina A los mejores c